---@field isDataAction? boolean Whether the operation applies to data-plane. This is "true" for data-plane operations and "false" for ARM/control-plane operations.
---@field display? azure.cognitiveservices.OperationDisplay Localized display information for this particular operation.
---@field origin? azure.cognitiveservices.OperationOrigin The intended executor of the operation; as in Resource Based Access Control (RBAC) and audit logs UX. Default value is "user,system"
